{"seq":3,"slug":"surcharge-access-surcharge-rule","title":"入户附加费与可达性判定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bulky-goods-whiteglove-delivery/two-man-delivery-scheduling/surcharge-access-surcharge-rule","wordCount":1496,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"入户附加费与可达性判定\">入户附加费与可达性判定</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>附加费在大件履约里是一个被误解最深的东西。它常被当作「价格表上的一行」，但正确的定位是：<strong>附加费是可达性判定的一个纯函数</strong>。判定的输入是第 2.2 篇（<a href=\"../two-man-delivery-scheduling/appointment-slot-stair-elevator\">预约时段与楼梯/电梯/入户限制</a>）的可达性档案，输出是一个三态结论——可达（免费或标准费）、条件可达（加收）、不可达（改约或拒单）——费用规则只是这个结论到金额的映射。</p>\n<p>这一定位有一个重要的工程后果：<strong>费用规则不应该反过来影响判定的真值</strong>。如果系统允许「客户付了加急费就跳过可达性检查」，那就是用钱买通了物理约束，结果必然是现场无法作业。判定与定价必须是单向依赖。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; Draft: 建档&#10;  Draft --&gt; Evaluating: 字段齐备&#10;  Evaluating --&gt; Accessible: 全部条件满足&#10;  Evaluating --&gt; Conditional: 满足但需额外作业&#10;  Evaluating --&gt; Inaccessible: 存在硬阻塞&#10;  Evaluating --&gt; Insufficient: 关键字段 unknown&#10;  Insufficient --&gt; Evaluating: 补齐字段&#10;  Conditional --&gt; Priced: 应用附加费规则&#10;  Accessible --&gt; Priced&#10;  Inaccessible --&gt; Reroute: 改约/改配送方式&#10;  Priced --&gt; Confirmed&#10;  Confirmed --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; Draft: 建档\n  Draft --&gt; Evaluating: 字段齐备\n  Evaluating --&gt; Accessible: 全部条件满足\n  Evaluating --&gt; Conditional: 满足但需额外作业\n  Evaluating --&gt; Inaccessible: 存在硬阻塞\n  Evaluating --&gt; Insufficient: 关键字段 unknown\n  Insufficient --&gt; Evaluating: 补齐字段\n  Conditional --&gt; Priced: 应用附加费规则\n  Accessible --&gt; Priced\n  Inaccessible --&gt; Reroute: 改约/改配送方式\n  Priced --&gt; Confirmed\n  Confirmed --&gt; [*]</pre><h2 id=\"规则表的结构\">规则表的结构</h2><h3 id=\"三态判定先于定价\">三态判定先于定价</h3><p>判定层输出的是一个枚举，不是金额。这样做的价值在于：字段可以重算，判定的结果可以审计，而金额可以随促销与合同变化而不影响判定逻辑。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判定结论</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>后续动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Accessible</td>\n<td>电梯可用且尺寸通过，或楼层在标准范围</td>\n<td>标准费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Conditional</td>\n<td>需走楼梯、需拆件、需吊装、超出免费搬运距离</td>\n<td>应用对应附加费项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Inaccessible</td>\n<td>包件无法通过任何可行路径（门宽/转角/电梯均不满足且不可拆）</td>\n<td>改约（拆件配送/上门吊装评估）或拒单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Insufficient</td>\n<td>关键字段为 unknown 且无法在派送前补齐</td>\n<td>保守估价 + 派送前复核</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"规则表建模\">规则表建模</h3><p>附加费规则应当是可叠加的<strong>费用项集合</strong>，每项独立判定，而不是一棵互斥的决策树。原因是现实中多个条件经常同时成立：既没有电梯、又超过了免费搬运距离、还需要拆件。互斥的决策树无法表达叠加，会导致规则爆炸。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE surcharge_rule (&#10;  rule_id        TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  applies_to     TEXT NOT NULL,          -- 判定结论,如 conditional&#10;  trigger_field  TEXT NOT NULL,          -- 如 stairs_flight_count&#10;  operator       TEXT NOT NULL,          -- gte / eq / range&#10;  threshold      JSONB NOT NULL,         -- 如 {&quot;gte&quot;: 1}&#10;  calc_mode      TEXT NOT NULL,          -- flat / per_unit / tiered&#10;  amount         NUMERIC(10,2),&#10;  currency       TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  tier_table     JSONB,&#10;  requires_mutual_exclusion_with TEXT[],&#10;  effective_from DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_to   DATE,&#10;  disclosure_text TEXT NOT NULL&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> surcharge_rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  applies_to     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 判定结论,如 conditional</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trigger_field  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 如 stairs_flight_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  operator       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- gte / eq / range</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  threshold      JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 如 {\"gte\": 1}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  calc_mode      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- flat / per_unit / tiered</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tier_table     JSONB,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  requires_mutual_exclusion_with </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_to   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  disclosure_text </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个字段决定这张表是否可用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>calc_mode</code>：阶梯计费与按件计费必须是一等公民。楼梯费的合理形态是阶梯（1–2 层一个价、3–5 层加价、逐层递增），而不是固定价乘以层数。</li>\n<li><code>requires_mutual_exclusion_with</code>：某些项互斥（例如已收整体吊装费就不再收楼梯费），把它显式声明出来，比在代码里写 if 更容易审计。</li>\n<li><code>disclosure_text</code>：这一项是合规要求，不是文案装饰。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"阶梯计费的表达\">阶梯计费的表达</h3><p>以楼梯费为例，阶梯表的形态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;rule_id&quot;: &quot;SR-STAIR-01&quot;,&#10;  &quot;trigger_field&quot;: &quot;stairs_flight_count&quot;,&#10;  &quot;operator&quot;: &quot;gte&quot;,&#10;  &quot;threshold&quot;: { &quot;gte&quot;: 1 },&#10;  &quot;calc_mode&quot;: &quot;tiered&quot;,&#10;  &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;EUR&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tier_table&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;from&quot;: 1, &quot;to&quot;: 2, &quot;amount&quot;: 19 },&#10;    { &quot;from&quot;: 3, &quot;to&quot;: 5, &quot;amount&quot;: 39 },&#10;    { &quot;from&quot;: 6, &quot;to&quot;: null, &quot;amount&quot;: 69, &quot;requires_manual_review&quot;: true }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;disclosure_text&quot;: &quot;无电梯且需人工搬运上楼，按楼层阶梯收取搬运费&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rule_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SR-STAIR-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"trigger_field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"stairs_flight_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"operator\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gte\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"threshold\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"gte\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"calc_mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tiered\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EUR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tier_table\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">19</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">39</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">69</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"requires_manual_review\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"disclosure_text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"无电梯且需人工搬运上楼，按楼层阶梯收取搬运费\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>requires_manual_review</code> 这一项处理的是长尾：超过六层的楼梯搬运在大件里几乎必然伴随转角受限与作业时长失控，此时自动计费不如人工评估。把这一类出口显式留在规则表里，比让客服事后手工改价要可控。</p>\n<h2 id=\"免费搬运距离与边界判定\">免费搬运距离与边界判定</h2><h3 id=\"距离的定义\">距离的定义</h3><p>「免费搬运距离」是客户地址到货车实际停车位之间的距离，不是直线距离。这个区别在小区内部道路上很关键：直线 30 米可能是绕行 120 米。判定应以地图算出的步行路径距离为准，并把 <code>parking_distance_m</code> 的采集口径写进字段定义（见第 2.2 篇的档案表）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"超距计费\">超距计费</h3><p>超距通常按分段计费而不是线性，因为重量与体积不随距离变化，而作业的体力消耗在距离上有明显的非线性。同时应当设置一个<strong>上限触发点</strong>：超过某个距离就应当考虑吊装或转运，而不是让两人抬着沙发走三百米。</p>\n<h2 id=\"价格展示与合规\">价格展示与合规</h2><h3 id=\"前置披露\">前置披露</h3><p>附加费必须在客户下单前披露，而不是在派送前一天通知。这不是服务水准问题而是法律问题。在欧盟的消费者权益框架下，<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/HTML/?uri=uriserv:OJ.L_.2011.304.01.0064.01.ENG\">Directive 2011/83/EU</a> 对远程合同规定了详尽的前合同信息义务，其中包含价格与额外费用的披露；同期的实践共识还包括：附加项不得默认勾选（客户必须主动选择才会被收费），且对客服电话不得收取高于基本费率的费用。落到大件场景，需要确认三件事：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>可达性问题在结算页就要问</strong>，不能跳过；</li>\n<li><strong>附加费要作为明细行展示</strong>，并附 <code>disclosure_text</code>；</li>\n<li><strong>不得预勾选</strong>任何付费附加项，包括「优先时段」「上楼搬运」这类。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"争议的举证基础\">争议的举证基础</h3><p>一旦客户对附加费提出异议，平台需要能回看当时的判定依据。因此 <code>surcharge_rule</code> 的应用结果必须<strong>快照</strong>到订单上（规则 ID、触发字段值、金额、披露文案），而不是只存一个金额、事后再去查规则表。规则表会随时间变化，快照是唯一能重建当时判定的方式。这与第 4.3 篇（<a href=\"../haulaway-damage-exception/whiteglove-csat-nps\">送装满意度与复购指标</a>）里的「附加费争议率」指标直接相关——没有快照，争议率这个指标本身就无从计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>附加费是可达性判定的纯函数，判定层输出三态枚举（可达/条件可达/不可达），定价只做结论到金额的映射；判定与定价单向依赖，不可逆。</li>\n<li>规则表是<strong>可叠加的费用项集合</strong>而非互斥决策树；<code>calc_mode</code> 支持阶梯与按件，<code>requires_mutual_exclusion_with</code> 显式声明互斥，<code>disclosure_text</code> 承担合规披露。</li>\n<li>免费搬运距离按步行路径而非直线距离判定，超距计费分段并设上限触发点。</li>\n<li>附加费必须在下单前披露、不得默认勾选，这既是体验要求也是欧盟消费者权益框架下的合规要求。</li>\n<li>应用结果必须快照到订单（规则 ID、触发值、金额、文案），否则争议无法举证、争议率指标无法计算。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"入户附加费与可达性判定","id":"入户附加费与可达性判定"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"规则表的结构","id":"规则表的结构"},{"level":3,"text":"三态判定先于定价","id":"三态判定先于定价"},{"level":3,"text":"规则表建模","id":"规则表建模"},{"level":3,"text":"阶梯计费的表达","id":"阶梯计费的表达"},{"level":2,"text":"免费搬运距离与边界判定","id":"免费搬运距离与边界判定"},{"level":3,"text":"距离的定义","id":"距离的定义"},{"level":3,"text":"超距计费","id":"超距计费"},{"level":2,"text":"价格展示与合规","id":"价格展示与合规"},{"level":3,"text":"前置披露","id":"前置披露"},{"level":3,"text":"争议的举证基础","id":"争议的举证基础"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"预约时段与楼梯/电梯/入户限制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bulky-goods-whiteglove-delivery/two-man-delivery-scheduling/appointment-slot-stair-elevator"},"next":{"title":"开箱、组装与安装作业","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bulky-goods-whiteglove-delivery/assembly-install-service/unbox-assembly-install"}}